fluxecho.recipe.vis_charger=Vis Charging
fluxecho.essentia_echo.tip=§3Synthesizes, on demand, every aspect your team has held once: no alchemical furnace, no alembics§r\nNeeds an Essentia Outlet next to it: an infusion matrix within 12 blocks draws from the outlet, essentia tubes pull from it\nPer essentia: its primal units x %s EU (a primal is 1 unit, Lux 2, ...)\nPlus shard credit: one vis crystal shard pays for %s units; keep shards in the input\nLearn aspects: put a filled phial, jar or crystal into the input (it goes to the output), or right-click the machine with it\nTakes up to %3$s A
fluxecho.vis_charger.tip=§3Charges wands, sceptres, staves and vis amulets from EU, no node needed§r\nOnly the primals your team has learned: put the matching shard into the input (or right-click with it)\nThe wand charges in the input and moves to the output once full\n%s EU per vis; one shard pays for %s vis (summed over the primals)
