# blood magic
gt.blockmachines.fluxecho.blood_echo.name=Blood Echo
fluxecho.recipe.blood_echo=Blood Echo
fluxecho.blood_echo.tip=§3Makes LP from EU and a little meat: no more self-sacrifice§r\nSpecial slot: a bound blood orb; it stays there and its level sets the pace (weak %s LP/t ... transcendent %s LP/t)\n%s EU per LP; one raw meat or rotten flesh in the input per %s LP\nNo circuit or circuit 1: into the main tank of a blood altar within %s blocks (%s up or down)\nCircuit 2: into the orb owner's soul network, up to the orb's capacity\nWaits while the altar or network is full
